meta {
  name: getSuppliers
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getSuppliers",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve suppliers

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `supplier_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by internal supplier IDs |
  | `external_supplier_id` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by supplier code (the supplier's external reference) |

  **Example: All suppliers**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getSuppliers",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "suppliers": [
      {
        "supplier_id": 1,
        "external_supplier_id": "MAIN",
        "supplier_name": "Main Supplier",
        "country_code": "NL",
        "gln": "9876543210123"
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 1000,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
